# The checkouts the end-to-end check runs against (test/e2e/run.sh). One place for both pins:
# run.sh reads this file, and the `e2e` job in .github/workflows/ci.yml appends it to $GITHUB_ENV
# and passes each SHA as the `ref` of its actions/checkout steps. Bump them together with a
# passing `just e2e`; see CONTEXT.md, "The end-to-end check".

